        "body": "My end goal is rendering and controlling a robot in Unity using mujoco physics. The robot was designed on Fusion360. My question is: What would be the best practice? Importing the model to mujoco first and importing the mujoco scene into unity? or importing the model directly to unity and adding the scripts from the unity engine?  In case I have to import first to mujoco, is there an established pipeline to convert the model to a mujoco-friendly format?\r\n\r\nThank you so much. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
